{"summary":"Exploring Football from a Unique Perspective","description":"Football Referee Simulator—the groundbreaking mobile game that puts you in the referee's shoes! Are you ready to kickstart your career in the lower divisions and ascend to legendary status by overseeing thrilling finals?\n\n*** Experience Real-Time Game Simulation! ***\n\nStep onto the pitch and play a pivotal role in the game's outcome! With real-time simulation, every decision you make holds the power to shape the course of the match!\n\n** Craft Your Journey and Elevate Your Character! **\n\nShape your own persona and chase after your goals! Stay updated with post-game news, claim prestigious awards, and elevate your personal stats!\n\n* Explore a Vast Football Universe! *\n\nImmerse yourself in a world featuring over 100 diverse clubs, 16 national teams, and a multitude of leagues and tournaments waiting to be conquered.\n\nNo ads. No in-game purchases. All content is unlocked upon purchase. Football Referee Simulator offers seamless gameplay without interruptions.\n\nLocalized in 11 languages—English, Spanish, Portuguese, French, German, Italian, Turkish, Indonesian, Polish, Greek and Russian—immerse yourself in the game in your preferred language!","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/cRDjFt4LpTI?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/F0VI_JImMl3eSJo8SgiAu8JOzXe_I1G15987P1EldWYHc_NV8WUkii604vYJoJNgVzWm0e_XvVX6FctMXbWe","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/i5Ms7iumkDat6M5BqplZtSVSlq7GtAeIv94R-zOB16o3fI2OSmTJ1o0h2hW9hf63Rwr9vO_NLP8_YGklteGnXQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/GHdeV1qfpqvy8bcL0z5snx-Rix29KEjjjF077nooQOrjBadTUkOp3ncNYuCy6vb7rSEpEGyM9JgD_DL-bhhfZg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Dot0DujRjNNRDMz7b_aJeWKsvu0p7mH39PkCpLYK4T8xytYigbp05Wm34LiDecRcydtnrh3dpjNDdobPxe9YrA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/e5mZdDjoqvfZb5wbVDIRv3fhpV_r6Kt_yw9wcYvHSpPfX